  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "num_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Number counters\n\nFormat Number turns numbers into text for labels and counters. Three readouts of one eased count-up (Smoothstep over the loop, scaled by Math): money with a thousands separator and two decimals, a percentage, and a compact count (12.3k). The clock below is the loop's time as m:ss.ff.\n\nIt formats whole spreads too: wire a list of numbers in for a list of labels.",
        "width": 470,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Number counters\n\nFormat Number turns numbers into text for labels and counters. Three readouts of one eased count-up (Smoothstep over the loop, scaled by Math): money with a thousands separator and two decimals, a percentage, and a compact count (12.3k). The clock below is the loop's time as m:ss.ff.\n\nIt formats whole spreads too: wire a list of numbers in for a list of labels.",
        "width": 470,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
